  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '


    Space - play/pause the simulation.

    Q - select tool. Select
    a rectangle of cells to use other tools on. The selected cells are inclusive.

    C
    - copy tool. Copy the selected cells to a text file. If no cells are selected,
    copy the whole board. (Text file location: appdata/local/Conway).

    V - paste
    tool. Paste the copied cells from a text file to the board. While in paste mode,
    press Left Click to place structure, E to rotate the copied structure, T to transpose
    the copied structure, Right Click to change, which corner the mouse is on, X
    to change whether to ignore dead cells, I to invert dead and alive cells.

    N
    - simulate next frame.

    Delete - clear tool. Kills all alive selected cells
    or all alive cells if none are selected.

    F - fill tool. Sets all selected
    cells or all cells on the board if none are selected as alive .

    R - randomize
    tool. Randomly set the selected cells or all the cells, if none are selected,
    to be alive or dead.

    P - import a picture to be turned into a structure
    based on how bright each pixel is. If the height or width of the picture is more
    than 100px, it will be shrunk to 100px in that dimension. Darker pixels are considered
    alive.

    Z - undo move.

    Y - redo move.

    H - opens/closes the help
    screen.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
